<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20113" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλῆμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάλλω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throw, cast</i>, of dice, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλα βλήματ᾽ ἐν κύβοις βαλεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					330
				</span></i>
			; of a missile, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				10.16
			</span></i>; of <i>the missile</i> itself, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.431
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				9.8
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>shot, wound</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				2.14
			</span></i>(pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>coverlet,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				7.413
			</span></i> (Antip.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρτος ἐντεθρυμμένος καὶ
					θερμός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Seleuc.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.114d
			</span></i> (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλήθα</span></b>  in <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>).</div>
